# The Old Woods: east out of town along Main Street. Pines and birch round a lily pond; berries, mushrooms
# and herbs come up fresh each morning on a few spots (areas.c: woods), catfish and koi rise in the pond, and
# the hollow log by the south path holds something different every day. Nothing is built here: a place to visit.
map WOODS set=FARM w=24 h=18 music=SPRING
